    "title": "Murals a \"wow statement\" in downtown Great Falls, eighth anual festival underway - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jenn Rowell ,\n7 hours ago The downtown mural festival is back this week, bringing a burst of activity, color and vibrancy. It’s the eighth annual Great Walls, formerly ArtsFest Montana, festival curated by Cameron Moberg, an internationally known muralist based in California who started painting in Great Falls on the invitation of a friend in collaboration with NeighborWorks Great Falls in 2018. Read full article\n1",
